  "description": "⭐ <em>At Royal Botanic Gardens, Kew, the <strong>Nash Sessions </strong>bring distinctive evenings of live music to an iconic setting. From candlelit jazz and reimagined pop classics to smooth Rat Pack swing, each performance blends timeless style with exceptional musicianship. Don’t miss it!</em><br>\r\n<br>\r\n✨ Are you a Kew Member? Get discounted tickets by following <a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/592474?c=kew-gardens-members&amp;thm=9473\" target=\"_blank\"><u>this link</u></a>. Please note that you will be asked to provide your membership number to validate your booking, so have it handy.&nbsp;<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🌿 Immerse in timeless music amid the stunning beauty of Kew Gardens' oldest glasshouse<br>\r\n🎷 Listen to smooth swing and Rat Pack classics with the charismatic Jazz Cats Quartet<br>\r\n🎶 Enjoy a special evening of wonderful ambiance and fabulous acoustics<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Dates and times: 24th September at 7:30 PM<br>\r\n⏳ Duration: 1 hour and 45 minutes. Doors open at 6:30 PM<br>\r\n📍 Location: Royal Botanic Gardens, Kew<br>\r\n🎟️ Daytime Garden entry is included in the price of the ticket. Please check Gardens opening times at&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.kew.org/kew-gardens/visit-kew-gardens\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kew.org/kew-<wbr>gardens/visit-kew-gardens</a><br>\r\n👤 Age requirement: all ages are welcome!<br>\r\n♿ Accessibility: the venue is wheelchair accessible, and all guests will be seated. For more information, please refer to the FAQs<br>\r\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vTKvCpzorpaM1xpEH-4xyZbAc85Gf3ayY_bEYyXxr0yl3A7guLgzEYrt6p2wy5-Ibof8lDGwiw0gRLC/pub\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n🎵&nbsp;<strong>Thursday 24th September - The Jazz Cats Quartet</strong><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>The Jazz Cats Quartet&nbsp;</strong>brings smooth, elegant swing to the stage in a stylish concert celebrating Sinatra, the Rat Pack, and the Great American Songbook. Fronted by a charismatic male vocalist, the band delivers timeless standards with sophistication, warmth, and irresistible groove. From classic ballads to up-tempo swingers, their polished arrangements and effortless charm evoke a golden era of jazz. Perfect for lovers of classic style, refined melodies, and an evening of timeless, feel-good musical entertainment.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nSet within the elegant surroundings of Royal Botanic Gardens, Kew, the Nash Sessions present unforgettable musical evenings. Timeless style, virtuosic performers, and an atmosphere of refined glamour await. Get your tickets today for <em>Nash Sessions at Royal Botanic Gardens, Kew&nbsp;</em>in London!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Seating Map</strong>\r\n<center><img align=\"middle\" class=\"extra-image-plan\" src=\"https://images.feverup.com/plan/photo/bc3273b8-1631-11f1-bdb0-d67741223778.png\" width=\"290px\"></center>",
